          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\displaystyle \\int_{0}^5 e^x \\, \\textrm d x.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Calculate [MATH: \\displaystyle \\int_{0}^5 e^x \\, \\textrm d x.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u222b_{0}^{5}e^{x}dx|= e^{x}|_{0}^{5}; = e^{5} \u2212 e^{0}; = e^{5} \u2212 1.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n[MATH: \u222b_{0}^{5}e^{x}dx|= e^{x}|_{0}^{5}; = e^{5} \u2212 e^{0}; = e^{5} \u2212 1.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: \\displaystyle \\int_{0}^5 e^x \\, \\textrm d x.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nTaking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get\n\n[MATH: \u222b_{0}^{5}e^{x}dx|= e^{x}|_{0}^{5}; = e^{5} \u2212 e^{0}; = e^{5} \u2212 1.]"
      },
