          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Taking the antiderivative and evaluating the difference at the bounds, we get</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u222b_{0}^{\u03c0/2}\\cos xdx|= \\sin x|_{0}^{\u03c0/2}; = \\sin ((\u03c0)/(2)) \u2212 \\sin (0); = 1 \u2212 0; = 1.]</span></p>",
