        "readable_text": "Prompt:\n[MATH: \u222b_{0}^{\u03c0/3}\\cos xdx =]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: (1)/(2)]\nb. [MATH: (sqrt(3) \u2212 1)/(2)]\nc. [MATH: (sqrt(3))/(2)]\nd. [MATH: (1 \u2212 sqrt(3))/(2)]\ne. [MATH: \u2212 (sqrt(3))/(2)]"
